  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526194",
      "title": "Scoped Styles",
      "lectureOrder": 113,
      "videoOrder": 96,
      "sourceHash": "1014d279c3e566e5bab0fc21317ac03e85bc05a9b1df7d0bd80aa314d99edadc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 6.55,
          "en": "We're going to stick to this global local theme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.55,
          "end": 8.44,
          "en": "Let's talk about styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.44,
          "end": 11.12,
          "en": "We know how to add dynamic styling and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.12,
          "end": 12.97,
          "en": "but I don't want to talk about this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.97,
          "end": 15.62,
          "en": "I want to talk about component styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.62,
          "end": 18.32,
          "en": "You can that you can add this style tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.32,
          "end": 20.06,
          "en": "to your '.vue' files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.06,
          "end": 22.79,
          "en": "and in here you can set up some styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.79,
          "end": 26.92,
          "en": "Now maybe you remember that earlier in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.92,
          "end": 31.66,
          "en": "I mentioned that no matter where you added your styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.66,
          "end": 35.42,
          "en": "it would always be treated as global styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.42,
          "end": 37.373,
          "en": "that affects the entire app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.35,
          "end": 41.264,
          "en": "So if I define a section h2 style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.264,
          "end": 44.53,
          "en": "here in the Badgelist.vue file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.53,
          "end": 46.43,
          "en": "This does not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.43,
          "end": 49.43,
          "en": "important, this does not mean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.43,
          "end": 53.32,
          "en": "that this styling would only affect this template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.32,
          "end": 56.59,
          "en": "Instead, indeed, it affects all files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.59,
          "end": 58.15,
          "en": "And I can show this to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.15,
          "end": 59.95,
          "en": "in TheHeader.vue file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.95,
          "end": 63.27,
          "en": "I am selecting the header element by its tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.27,
          "end": 65.523,
          "en": "and I'm applying a certain style here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.93,
          "end": 68.72,
          "en": "Now, in user info,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.72,
          "end": 71.46000000000001,
          "en": "I'm wrapping this h3 tag and my BaseBadge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.46000000000001,
          "end": 75.73,
          "en": "with a div and actually using a header element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.73,
          "end": 78.493,
          "en": "makes more sense semantically in my opinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.77,
          "end": 82.44,
          "en": "But if I switch to a header here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.44,
          "end": 83.273,
          "en": "you will see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.273,
          "end": 86.93,
          "en": "that now I got the header styling being applied here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.93,
          "end": 89.67,
          "en": "in my Userinfo component as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.67,
          "end": 92.113,
          "en": "And that of course breaks my style there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.99000000000001,
          "end": 94.50999999999999,
          "en": "Now this is happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.50999999999999,
          "end": 97.83,
          "en": "because I do have my header styling set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.83,
          "end": 98.93,
          "en": "in header.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.93,
          "end": 100.15,
          "en": "and as I explained,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.15,
          "end": 102.28999999999999,
          "en": "even though it's set up in that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.28999999999999,
          "end": 104.12299999999999,
          "en": "it affects the entire app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.96000000000001,
          "end": 106.99000000000001,
          "en": "Sometimes this is what you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.99000000000001,
          "end": 109.08,
          "en": "For example in App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.08,
          "end": 110.85,
          "en": "you typically do define",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.85,
          "end": 113.78,
          "en": "your global application wide styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.78,
          "end": 116.84,
          "en": "like setting the body or some font family.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.84,
          "end": 120.17,
          "en": "So styles that should affect everything in your app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.17,
          "end": 123.4,
          "en": "typically are defined in the style tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.4,
          "end": 125.17,
          "en": "of your App.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.17,
          "end": 126.85,
          "en": "Since this is your entry point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 126.85,
          "end": 128.393,
          "en": "of the entire application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 130.21,
          "end": 133.58,
          "en": "But if you have styles in individual components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.58,
          "end": 136.69,
          "en": "it often would be nice if you could scope",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.69,
          "end": 139.23,
          "en": "these styles to those components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.23,
          "end": 142.64,
          "en": "to ensure that they really only affect the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.64,
          "end": 145.48,
          "en": "of the component in which you define them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 145.48,
          "end": 147.45,
          "en": "and vue supports this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.45,
          "end": 151.81,
          "en": "there is a scoped attribute which you can add to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.81,
          "end": 153.03300000000002,
          "en": "that style tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 155.84,
          "en": "And if you do add it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.84,
          "end": 159.97,
          "en": "that tells vue that the styles defined in here should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 159.97,
          "end": 163.75,
          "en": "only affect the template that lives in the same file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 163.75,
          "end": 167.349,
          "en": "and no other component, no child component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.349,
          "end": 169.21,
          "en": "no sibling component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 169.21,
          "end": 171.403,
          "en": "nothing else in your app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 172.27,
          "end": 175.14,
          "en": "And we can do this in all those components therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 175.14,
          "end": 176.31,
          "en": "so in the header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 176.31,
          "end": 177.143,
          "en": "I add scoped,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.143,
          "end": 179.754,
          "en": "in Userinfo I just added it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 179.754,
          "end": 183.17,
          "en": "in BaseBadge I'm going to add it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 184.76,
          "end": 188.26,
          "en": "And in BadgeList, I'm also going to add it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 188.26,
          "end": 190.713,
          "en": "to make all those styles scoped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 192.35,
          "end": 193.8,
          "en": "And if we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 193.8,
          "end": 197.19,
          "en": "you see now we no longer have this style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 197.19,
          "end": 199.79,
          "en": "this header style being applied here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 199.79,
          "end": 204.23,
          "en": "We also see that some styles broke because I relied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 204.23,
          "end": 206.05,
          "en": "on this global sharing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.05,
          "end": 208.711,
          "en": "but I actually rather fix those broken styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 208.711,
          "end": 211.05,
          "en": "than having this side effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 211.05,
          "end": 213.586,
          "en": "of being restricted which element I can use where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 213.586,
          "end": 217.31,
          "en": "or of being forced that I have to ensure manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 217.31,
          "end": 219.14,
          "en": "that styles don't spill over",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 219.14,
          "end": 220.673,
          "en": "and destroy my layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 221.57,
          "end": 224.02,
          "en": "So therefore here, in Userinfo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 224.02,
          "end": 226.7,
          "en": "I'm simply targeting the section header here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 226.7,
          "end": 229.763,
          "en": "to fix the styling in my Userinfo header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 230.95,
          "end": 233.21,
          "en": "And regarding the available badges,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 233.21,
          "end": 234.93,
          "en": "here in BadgeList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 234.93,
          "end": 237.88,
          "en": "The problem is that the section lost its styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 237.88,
          "end": 240.823,
          "en": "because I did define that styling here in Userinfo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 241.88,
          "end": 244.1,
          "en": "Well, I'm simply going to copy that over",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 244.1,
          "end": 245.53,
          "en": "to BadgeList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 245.53,
          "end": 248.72,
          "en": "add it there, save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 248.72,
          "end": 249.713,
          "en": "and it's back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 250.87,
          "end": 253.1,
          "en": "So that's scoped styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 253.1,
          "end": 256.78,
          "en": "a super useful feature to make sure that your styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 256.78,
          "end": 258.88,
          "en": "really only affects the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 258.88,
          "end": 260.85,
          "en": "in which you're defining it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 260.85,
          "end": 262.01,
          "en": "Now in case you're wondering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 262.01,
          "end": 265.1,
          "en": "how vue actually implements this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 265.1,
          "end": 267.86,
          "en": "If you inspect this with your developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 267.86,
          "end": 269.11,
          "en": "in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 269.11,
          "end": 271.36,
          "en": "You will notice that vue achieves this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 271.36,
          "end": 275.67,
          "en": "by giving your elements special attributes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 275.67,
          "end": 279.193,
          "en": "like this data-, V- something attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 280.22,
          "end": 281.94,
          "en": "Now this is added by vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 281.94,
          "end": 283.64,
          "en": "and you've seen the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 283.64,
          "end": 287.94,
          "en": "actually vue changes your selector behind the scenes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 287.94,
          "end": 289.99,
          "en": "like this header selector here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 289.99,
          "end": 292.43,
          "en": "to actually now be header plus",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 292.43,
          "end": 294.45,
          "en": "this generated attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 294.45,
          "end": 296.58,
          "en": "And since every component's template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 296.58,
          "end": 298.51,
          "en": "will receive its own attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 298.51,
          "end": 301.74,
          "en": "This ensures that styling is scoped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 301.74,
          "end": 304.263,
          "en": "to that component's template markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 306.42,
          "end": 309.49,
          "en": "That's how vue implements this behind the scenes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 309.49,
          "end": 311.19,
          "en": "with this custom attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 311.19,
          "end": 313.223,
          "en": "and by adjusting your selectors.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
